before (all new code is behind `if _CHECKSUM_ENABLED:`). With it set to
1, `grep RESTORE_CHECKSUM qwen.log` produces STORE_DONE / LOAD_SUBMIT /
RESTORE_READ lines during test_kv_cache_identity_corruption.py runs, see
RESULTS-restore-corruption.md Phase C for the actual triangulation.

